    <string name="push_steps">In Bambuddy, open Settings › Notifications and add a provider of type Webhook. Paste the address above as the webhook URL, keep the payload format Generic, and turn off \"attach photo\" (pictures are too big for push messages). Then pick the events you want and send a test: it shows up here.</string>
